id: pm-todos-p60g
title: Bring pm-todos to 100% line/branch/function coverage and raise gate to 100
description: "The coverage gate currently enforces lines 68 / branches 85 / functions 74. Drive every uncovered code path in index.ts with behavioural tests so all three metrics read 100.00, then raise coverageGate.thresholds to 100."
type: Task
status: open
priority: 2
tags: []
created_at: "2026-09-18T03:15:38.568Z"
updated_at: "2026-09-18T05:42:24.700Z"
assignee: pi-agent
claim_principal: pi-agent
author: pi-agent
acceptance_criteria: "npm run coverage reports 100.00 for lines, branches, and functions; coverageGate.thresholds in package.json is 100 for each metric; npm run release:check exits 0; no gate is weakened"
comments[3]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-09-18T03:15:53.333Z",pi-agent,"Baseline: lines 69.31 / branches 87.09 / functions 76.07 (index.ts only). 206 tests passing. Uncovered ranges: 168-275 (option readers), 316-345 (export filter + bounded int), 492-504 (context sort branches), 545-547 (NaN deadline), 621-623 (bang markers), 855-858 (filterBySection), 1239-1325 (parsePiTodo + helpers), 1684-1685 (malformed checkbox), 1779-1988 (glob + parseFileToNormalized), 2123-2315 (pm command runners), 2345-2601 (runTodoImport), 2645-2748 (export core), 2801-3427 (extension commands/importers/exporters/preflight)."
  "2026-09-18T05:32:57.755Z",pi-agent,Added 65 direct option/internal-helper tests and 38 in-process SDK harness tests. The harness now covers validate/context/sync/import/export/legacy importer/preflight against one real temp pm workspace; command test suite passes 38/38.
  "2026-09-18T05:42:24.700Z",pi-agent,"Widened readCompletePmItems and runTodoImport exports only for in-process tests of their error branches. These paths are otherwise reachable only inside registered handlers; subprocess integration tests execute outside the coverage runner, while direct invocation preserves real pm CLI behavior for normal reads/writes and lets tests pin read failure, malformed receipt, and dropped-line handling."
body: ""
